    "biography": {
      "concept": "Purser of the Valhaulan fleet (Act 5)",
      "notes": "Ingrid Halvarsen is purser of the Valhaulan fleet. She keeps the crates, the fuel chits and the count, and counts everything twice, out loud, including you, without apology. She is clipped, fair and faintly offended by disorder, and she's the only Valhaulan who reads the paperwork. Piracy doesn't bother her; it's honest work. Sloppy numbers do. She will not lie to you about a number."
    }
